Port Crubit to the compiler API of rustc 1.100.0: ModChild and Reexport moved
to middle::resolve, RegionExt became inherent::RegionName, TraitPredicate and
PredicatePolarity became TraitClause and ClausePolarity, and
try_to_target_usize moved to ConstExt.

